  "compression": {
    "enabled": true,
    "rule": "Drop leading articles; cut linking/filler verbs (involves, is, are, means, represents) when parallel noun phrases carry the meaning; prefer parallel fragments joined by a comma; strip throat-clearing. Keep iconic verbatim lines. News: never drop an action verb. Example: 'The Power to Tax Involves the Power to Destroy' -> 'Power to Tax, Power to Destroy'.",
